  "goodToKnow": "Schwänzen means to skip school or a class without permission: die Schule schwänzen, Mathe schwänzen. Der Schulschwänzer is a truant. Germany has strict compulsory school attendance (Schulpflicht), and homeschooling is generally not allowed; parents can be fined, and police may even escort pupils to school in rare cases. The 2019 Fridays for Future school strikes sparked debate about schwänzen for the climate."
